<title>USA: AMR's SABRE Group year oper loss widens slip. [CORRECTED 00:03 GMT 16/1]</title>
<headline>AMR's SABRE Group year oper loss widens slip. [CORRECTED 00:03 GMT 16/1]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to reflect operating losses, not earnings)</p>
<p>			     1996			1995</p>
<p> Revenues	    $1,622,000	     $1,529,000</p>
<p> Oper expenses	1,295,000		1,149,000</p>
<p> Other income	   327,000		  380,000</p>
<p> Earnings (loss)     (21,000)		 (10,000)</p>
<p> income taxes</p>
<p> Pre-tax margin  18.9 percent	   24.2 percent</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: AMR spun off less than 20 pct of SABRE Group in October.</p>
</text>
